                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.002/629: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-05-03T18:00:00-04:00">May 3, 1938—6 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>138. Your 231, May 3, 11 a.m. The Department approves the reply made by you to
                    the Counselor of the British Embassy. Please repeat to Tokyo through
                    Shanghai.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
